  "slug": "general-contractor-punch-list-checklist-form",
  "title": "General Contractor Punch List and Verification Register",
  "subtitle": "Plan the walkthrough, record location-specific deficiencies, assign correction and evidence, control access and disputes, verify rework, and support accountable turnover.",
  "description": "A workflow-complete construction punch list covering milestone and walkthrough identity, readiness checks, deficiency classification, item ownership and due dates, inaccessible or disputed work, correction evidence, reinspection, turnover documents, acceptance conditions, and final closeout.",
  "use_case": "Use when a contractor, owner, or design team needs one fillable register to turn a walkthrough into traceable correction assignments and prove that every accepted item was reinspected or carried to an accountable exception.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
